{
  "$schema": "../../specs/erc7730-v2.schema.json",
  "_curation_note": "PQSigner semantic curation: all fifteen declared rswETH formats are admitted only for the fixed Ethereum proxy below. Standard token, allowance, burn, and whitelist routes show every signed operand. Deposits distinguish exact ETH credited from state-derived rswETH output and show the signed minimum where one exists. reprice shows all three signed accounting inputs and discloses its state-derived rate and configured reward recipients. withdrawERC20 states that the full contract token balance is sent to the authenticated platform-admin signer. Evidence pins the EIP-1967 implementation, proxy/implementation runtimes, Blockscout-verified source/ABI, rswETH metadata, AccessControlManager and its fixed-block DepositManager/treasury/operator bindings. It is historical authority, not live roles, rates, balances, whitelist/pause state, reward distribution, execution success, future proxy/configuration upgrades, fallback, or blind-signing authority.",
